          "content": "× on a split chat pane archives the chat instead of popping it out into its own tab. Every chat × confirms, running or stopped; the empty stub and the terminal × are unchanged; ⌘W in a split does what × does; ⋯ → Archive chat and the sidebar's Archive stay silent.",
