          "fill": "$text-low",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1452,
          "content": "PRECEDENCE — ERROR › NEEDS YOU › WORKING › UNREAD › STATUS UNAVAILABLE › QUIET.   Open human dialogs hold automatic inbox delivery; Working and Idle add no hold. Draft protection remains independent.   Spinners animate; human waits never blink or pulse.   Current labels: Working, Idle, Approval needed, Answer needed, Needs you, Starting, Resuming, Stopped, Error, Response failed and Status unavailable. Estimated activity is explained in the tooltip. Tool/compaction details, interruption text and elapsed waits remain additive refinements.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
