        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "sVYaV",
          "x": 24,
          "y": 645,
          "name": "note_f",
          "fill": "$text-mid",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1452,
          "content": "Clicking the indicator opens the affected pane and leaves the existing row-click behaviour alone. With several rows waiting, go to the oldest unresolved error first, then the oldest unresolved request, with pane order as a stable tie-breaker — never rotate the target simply because it was clicked. A collapsed project expands and reveals the tab. Attention keeps its reserved space when row actions or ⌘-number pills appear: the warning is never replaced by an ellipsis or a shortcut pill. Error attention is acknowledged by viewing the pane, while the pane's own Error status stays until recovery; needs-you attention persists until it is actually resolved.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
