          "fill": "$text-mid",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1452,
          "content": "A runner card and a pane header mean the same thing and look the same, which ends today's split where Busy is amber in a chat header and accent-coloured on a mission avatar. The card has room for a detail, so its subtitle carries one. The avatar's presence dot goes back to being only what it can prove — the process is live or it is not — and the agent's state is read from the glyph and label beside it.",
