          "content": "The pane header keeps its 26px row, its controls and their positions. Only the trailing 5px dot changes: a 12px glyph plus an 11px label sit after the truncating title, so the controls never shift as the state changes. Work detail belongs in the tooltip, not in a title that rewrites itself every few seconds.",
