          "content": "A · THE FOLDER PAIR — CLOSED WHEN COLLAPSED, OPEN WHEN EXPANDED, NEXT TO THE CHEVRON THAT ALREADY FLIPS",
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
