          "fill": "$text-mid",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1452,
          "content": "Working gains a verified detail: Using tools while a tool call is in flight, Compacting context between the compaction events. The pane header, the tab bar and the runner card subtitle show it in the label, in one short form from one function; the tooltip repeats it. Jason's call after testing on 2026-09-17: nobody hovers a header, so nothing lives only in a tooltip. The label slot reserves its width so a toggling detail never shifts the title or the buttons. An estimated Working never has a detail.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
