        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "gIrvt",
          "x": 700,
          "y": 422,
          "name": "note_c",
          "fill": "$text-mid",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 776,
          "content": "A single-pane row is the pane, so its tooltip is the pane's tooltip and says Working · Using tools. A multi-pane row, a project, a section and the mission row are rollups: they count working panes and never name a detail, because two panes can be doing different things. The mission tab strip keeps the glyph only. Nothing in the sidebar changes shape or colour for a detail.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "S2Y8Q",
          "x": 24,
          "y": 566,
          "name": "footer",
          "fill": "$text-mid",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1452,
          "content": "RULES — A detail is a hook fact, never an estimate: baseline Working shows no detail. Using tools starts at PreToolUse and ends at the owning result; Compacting context starts at PreCompact and ends at PostCompact, or on Copilot at the next work event or Stop. Between details the label is plain Working. A needs-you wait outranks both, as it does today. Detail never changes precedence, rollups or delivery gating.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "qKf92",
      "x": 27840,
      "y": 1693,
      "name": "Spec — Status details (624) · v1 · interrupted",
      "clip": true,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 610,
      "fill": "$bg",
      "layout": "none",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "b6Aal",
          "x": 24,
          "y": 20,
          "name": "spec_title",
          "fill": "$text-hi",
          "content": "Spec — Status details (624) · v1 · interrupted",
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "u1KWf",
          "x": 24,
          "y": 42,
          "name": "spec_sub",
          "fill": "$text-mid",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1452,
          "content": "An Escape or Ctrl+C ends the turn without a result. Idle keeps its glyph and gains an outcome the header label, the tab bar and the runner card name as Idle · Interrupted, with the tooltip spelling it out as Idle · Last response interrupted. No completion dot, no error, no attention, because the interruption was the user's own action. The next prompt clears it.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "UMAAt",
          "x": 24,
          "y": 96,
          "name": "cap_a",
          "fill": "$text-low",
          "content": "A · PANE HEADER AND TAB BAR — THE IDLE RING IS UNCHANGED. THE LABEL NAMES THE OUTCOME; THE TOOLTIP SPELLS IT OUT",
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
