          "fill": "$text-mid",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 920,
          "content": "Idle · Interrupted on the card, Idle · Last response interrupted in the tooltip: the card line is short because it sits under a handle, the tooltip is a sentence because it is read on purpose. The card keeps the Idle ring and the muted colour; an interruption is not a failure and never turns red or amber. A mission outcome still comes from mission events, never from this boundary.",
