          "x": 700,
          "y": 422,
          "name": "note_c",
          "fill": "$text-mid",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 776,
          "content": "An interrupted pane out of view stays quiet: there is no response to read, so no unread dot, and nothing for a rollup to count. The completed pane beside it keeps today's unread dot. A rollup tooltip lists working, waits, errors and unread as it does now; interrupted is never a count. The mission tab strip shows the Idle ring. A single-pane row's tooltip says Idle · Last response interrupted, the same sentence as the pane header.",
