          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1452,
          "content": "RULES — Codex publishes a native Interrupt hook; Claude Code and Copilot publish none, so Runner records the outcome from its own Escape and Ctrl+C signal, as shipped in 347. The tooltip never says which. The outcome lasts until the next prompt, a resume or a restart. It never adds attention, never sets unread and never holds delivery. Baseline sessions keep Idle · estimated from terminal activity and never claim an interruption.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "HiZ5G",
      "x": 29460,
      "y": 1693,
      "name": "Spec — Status details (624) · v1 · wait timers",
      "clip": true,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 610,
      "fill": "$bg",
      "layout": "none",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "BRUgg",
          "x": 24,
          "y": 20,
          "name": "spec_title",
          "fill": "$text-hi",
          "content": "Spec — Status details (624) · v1 · wait timers",
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "MlNT3",
          "x": 24,
          "y": 42,
          "name": "spec_sub",
          "fill": "$text-mid",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1452,
          "content": "A wait is the one state where time matters, so the header label, the tab bar and the runner card say how long the session has been on Approval needed or Answer needed, in whole minutes from the first minute on, and the tooltip has the seconds. The clock starts when the interaction is raised and belongs to that interaction: a second approval starts its own. Glyphs, colours and rollups do not change; time is information, not escalation.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "iDjCt",
          "x": 24,
          "y": 96,
