          "x": 812,
          "y": 288,
          "name": "note_b",
          "fill": "$text-mid",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 664,
          "content": "Approval needed · 2m: the state keeps its amber and its weight, the timer is regular and muted, exactly the split the Working detail uses. The card ticks on the minute and shows nothing under a minute, so a rail of cards never flickers with seconds. The tooltip on the card is the pane's tooltip and has the seconds. 216 px fits Approval needed · 1h 12m.",
